sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Note over App, Node: Pairing failure with specific PairingFailedReason

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Node: Authentication requirements mismatch
        App->>Node: GapCentral.PairAndBond()
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(<br>pairedSuccessfully=false,<br>reason=authenticationRequirementsNotMet)

        Note over App: Peer requires higher security level<br>than our IoCapabilities can provide.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Node: Encryption failed after SMP
        App->>Node: GapCentral.PairAndBond()
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.AuthenticationRequired(<br>isNumericComparison=true, passkey=485923)
        App->>Node: GapCentral.NumericComparisonConfirm(true)
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(<br>pairedSuccessfully=false,<br>reason=encryptionFailed)

        Note over App: SMP key exchange succeeded but link-layer<br>encryption setup failed. Connection may drop.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Node: Re-encryption with stale bond
        App->>Node: GapCentral.PairAndBond()
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(<br>pairedSuccessfully=false,<br>reason=keyRejected)
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(standby)

        Note over App: Stored bond keys no longer accepted by peer.<br>Remove bond and re-pair from scratch.
    end
